OL,3,GNEWSAFire destroys 140 cars at site
OL,4,Aused by Gatwick passengers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Gatwick Airport,
OL,7,Fwhich does not own the site, said it
OL,8,F"understands how concerning and
OL,9,Fdistressing this will be" for
OL,10,Fpassengers, and urged those affected to
OL,11,Fcontact police.
